  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Aladdin** (1 review): Aladdin was preceded by a new intro whose title is unknown, and the two were played as a segue [2]\n- **Vapor** (1 review): Vapor was listed with a note that the tune was formerly called \"Kraz Fast\" [2]\n- **Reverb** (1 review): Reverb was noted as a tune formerly known under the name \"J-Live\" [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Fast Maceo / Crosstown Traffic**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Uncle Junior / Chameleon**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2004-09-24.shnf** (recommended): source not stated; 13 songs; 116 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: New [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2004-09-24.shnf**: taped by Mike B; transferred by Mike B; source: Scheops MK41's/CMC6 (FOB x-y) -> Mogami XLR -> Lunatec V3 16bit -> coax SPDIF w/Oade active 7 pin -> Sony M1 (Sony DG60P) [1]",
